  description: 'A tight pinwheel of narrow petals radiating from a dark center, genuinely
    spinning in a stiff breeze rather than just looking like it should.


    Only
    in full, honest sunlight does it do anything at all  but caught in direct light,
    its spin carries a ward out to every plant nearby.'
  descriptionSecondary: While in direct sunlight, it wards every plant within range
    against miasma. Move it to shade or let night fall and the ward drops the instant
    the sun does.
